License of the patches in this directory

The patches in this directory change Qt source code. They are licensed
under the same open-source terms as the Qt modules that they change:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-only OR GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only

You can use the patches under any one of these three licenses. The full
license texts are in the LICENSES directory:

- LICENSES/LGPL-3.0-only.txt
- LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt
- LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt

The LGPL v3 adds permissions to the GPL v3, so LGPL-3.0-only.txt must be
read together with GPL-3.0-only.txt.

These terms cover the changes made by the patches. The Qt code around the
changes keeps the license stated in each Qt source file.

Exception: qtmultimedia-wsola-pitch-compensation.patch adds a copy of the
SoundTouch library (src/3rdparty/soundtouch/). SoundTouch is by Olli
Parviainen and is licensed under the LGPL v2.1 or later, as stated in its
own files. That license is compatible with the LGPL v3.

The rest of this repository (tools/, versions/ and .github/) is licensed
under the GPL v3 or later. See ../LICENSE. The GPL of these scripts does
not apply to the Qt kits that they build.
